busting butt! We didn't wait long because it was only two of us but it did get busy shortly thereafter. I LOVE their OJ because it is freshly squeezed. I will say I like my OJ cold but this OJ felt a little on the warmer side. That made me not want to finish it. It did take a little bit for someone to get to us. I think they only had four waitresses for the whole place. We got to order and I had the crab cake benedict and my bf ordered the cafe breakfast. We also split the Pa..."},{"business_id":"vwOJ4yZH1I85-T3dJyr2ig","review_id":"SFdyWD_2DOB94IapFoYn-w","date":"2021-08-03T15:42:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9347066879272461,"text_excerpt":"Great breakfast. I ended up coming here two days in a row. The first day I had a MYO omelette with crab, shrimp and veggies and grits! The second day I had the French toast. The service was great! I would totally recommend checking this place out."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vwOJ4yZH1I85-T3dJyr2ig","photo_id":"V5jcs--Zg83eyMupmHwdYg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/V5jcs--Zg83eyMupmHwdYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9211931228637695},{"business_id":"vwOJ4yZH1I85-T3dJyr2ig","photo_id":"fxaZbDmQMzJJj3AV_a2gRA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/fxaZbDmQMzJJj3AV_a2gRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8670253157615662},{"business_id":"vwOJ4yZH1I85-T3dJyr2ig","photo_id":"eRv5qDzXMKwJXM6mJJQdaw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eRv5qDzXMKwJXM6mJJQdaw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8394330143928528},{"business_id":"vwOJ4yZH1I85-T3dJyr2ig","photo_id":"q0ytvvz9Z6rjeDW1QG30lQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/q0ytvvz9Z6rjeDW1QG30lQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7998234033584595},{"business_id":"vwOJ4yZH1I85-T3dJyr2ig","photo_id":"En8xR3MRBuTbSOzC1wlhpA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/En8xR3MRBuTbSOzC1wlhpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7889748811721802}]},"notebook_case":null}
